Short:     A pack of very good DayDream doors.
Author:    Many
Uploader:  c-lous@freenet.hut.fi
Replaces:  comm/bbs/DayDreamBBSDoo.Lha
Version:   1.4

Theese are some doors for you to get started with. The pack will be updated
now and then as new quality doors pop up. Please note that some of theese
doors do require a 68020+.

New since last version: ImageView in a new version.


Dead Or Alive 1.2 (MST-DA12.LHA)  ImageView 1.3 (MST-IV13.LHA)
--------------------------------------------------------------
Author: Mamba/Mystic

Dead Or Alive is a great Request door wich is one of the most solid solutions
for a request door I have seen.

ImageView is a great WHO door wich, optionally, can offer configurable
output for every single user, but can aswell function as a frontend/
normal WHO door.


ToyMenu 2.0 (INS-TM20.LHA)  TodayDream 1.0 (INS-TD10.LHA)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Author: Joo/ToyTools

ToyMenu is a joinconference door with alot of configurability. Must
be the best joinconf door for DayDream.

TodayDream shows your daily uploads as a nice bulletin. Many options and
nice look aswell.



UltraScan 1.1 (DCD!US10.LZX) SoulFront (MST-SF11.LZX),
TrimToMonth(TRIM2MON.LZX)    DreamExpressLog (MST-DEL1.LZX)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Author: Zed/DC^Mystic.

UltraScan is a GREAT reverse filescan door for DayDream. Looks very much like
AquaScan for /X. Includes reverse, sorted and forward scanner doors.

SoulFront is a nice FrontEnd door to put in FrontEnds.Dat, it shows some nice
info and statistics about your BBS.

TrimToMonth trims your DayDreamX.log to contain only the last months entries.

DreamExpressLog creates an /X logfile out of DayDream's logfile. This makes
some utils for AmiExpress work with DayDream aswell.


If you haven't got it, get hbasic2.library from Zed's homepage at:
http://www.mentasm.com/~zed/




